CM_ "Research observations only. Unknown fields and candidates are not validated vehicle control interfaces. Read docs/protocol.md and docs/calibration.md.";
CM_ SG_ 166 Raw_B0_bits0_0 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 166 FuelCutStatus "high; source 07-V11. High-confidence deceleration fuel cut; 21 intervals, 694 interior fuel samples with zero increments. Not every cold or transient regime qualified.";
CM_ SG_ 166 Raw_B0_bits2_7 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 166 Raw_B1 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 166 ThrottleRequestLikeB2 "experimental; source 07-V13. Upstream request-like raw channel; not physical pedal percent or final actuator command.";
CM_ SG_ 166 ThrottleFeedbackB3 "obd-calibrated; source 07-V08. OBD-equivalent actual throttle feedback; derived linear fits in calibration.md, validated raw range 8..208. Not pedal position.";
CM_ SG_ 166 ThrottleRequestLikeB4 "experimental; source 07-V13. State-dependent request-like channel. Preserve separately from B2; a fixed subtraction does not reproduce it.";
CM_ SG_ 166 Raw_B5 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 166 Raw_B6 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 166 NibbleChecksum "protocol-validated; source 07-V13. Payload nibble-sum checksum; no identifier contribution. Validate outside DBC.";
CM_ SG_ 166 Raw_B7_bits4_5 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 166 RollingCounter "protocol-validated; source 07-V13. Modulo 4 per identifier; discontinuity is not an exact loss count.";
CM_ SG_ 200 SpeedA "high; source 07-V13. Preferred odometer-consistent nominal motion representation; absolute road-speed accuracy and factory role remain unverified.";
CM_ SG_ 200 Raw_B2 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 200 Raw_B3 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 200 SpeedB "high; source 07-V13. 2003 primary nominal speed. On 2007 about 2.06% higher than A; not an independent wheel speed. 2003 OBD-equivalent empirical alternative raw*0.0098.";
CM_ SG_ 200 DistanceTicksRaw "high; source 07-DISTANCE. Modulo 256. 164 ticks per factory odometer mile; 1609.344/164 m/tick. Odometer-relative, not GPS validated.";
CM_ SG_ 200 NibbleChecksum "protocol-validated; source 07-V13. Payload nibble-sum checksum; no identifier contribution. Validate outside DBC.";
CM_ SG_ 200 Raw_B7_bits4_5 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 200 RollingCounter "protocol-validated; source 07-V13. Modulo 4 per identifier; discontinuity is not an exact loss count.";
CM_ SG_ 212 LightingMode "high; source 07-V03. Reported mode, not measured lamp current. DRL output is not decoded by this enum.";
VAL_ 212 LightingMode 0 "off" 1 "parking" 2 "low beam" 3 "high beam or flash";
CM_ SG_ 212 ParkingBrake "high; source 07-V03. Set=applied switch/status; not holding force.";
CM_ SG_ 212 Raw_B0_bits3_4 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 212 CruiseMain "high; source 07-V03. Master enable, separate from engagement and ignition.";
CM_ SG_ 212 CruiseButton "high; source 07-V03. Extracted two-bit enum. Masked byte values are 00/40/80/C0; CANCEL is not two simultaneous independent buttons.";
VAL_ 212 CruiseButton 0 "none" 1 "SET/DECEL" 2 "RESUME/ACCEL" 3 "CANCEL";
CM_ SG_ 212 Raw_B1 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 212 Raw_B2_bits0_5 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 07-V05. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 212 AccessoryControlCandidate "experimental; source 07-V13. 2003 A/C-correlated behavior. 2007 asserts with fresh zero RPM for long intervals; not proof of compressor rotation, mechanical load or physical clutch engagement.";
CM_ SG_ 212 OilWarningStatus "high; source 07-V07. 2003 lifecycle-based candidate; 2007 lamp-identified. Boolean status only, never oil pressure in physical units.";
CM_ SG_ 212 FuelSenderRelatedB3 "high-related-raw; source 07-V13. Sender-related channel; angle-like interpretation historical on 2003. No confirmed tank percentage or gallons. 2007 output changes on approximately 200 ms grid.";
CM_ SG_ 212 FuelSenderRelatedB4 "high-related-raw; source 07-V13. Related inversely to B3. Historical 2003 5/255 V scaling is an approximation, not a direct voltmeter calibration; retain raw.";
CM_ SG_ 212 SecondarySpeedRaw "high-related-raw; source 07-V13. Filtered/smoothed speed-related field. Nominal raw/100 convention; fitted offsets are invalid near standstill. Not a separately decoded wheel speed.";
