VAL_ 392 ReportedGear 0 "Park or Neutral status; use selector" 1 "1st" 2 "2nd" 3 "3rd" 4 "4th" 5 "5th" 6 "Settled Reverse" 7 "Transition or unsettled status, not seventh gear";
